  - id: RUSH_INTRO
    title: "H\xE0 N\u1ED9i \xB7 n\u0103m 2004"
    subtitle: "M\xC0N 1 \xB7 NH\u1EEENG NG\xC0Y \u1EDE TR\u1ECC"
    chapter: 1
    ending: 0
    description: 
    narration: "H\xC0 N\u1ED8I, N\u0102M 2004\n\nT\xF4i l\xE0 Tr\u1EA7n V\u0103n Nam, sinh vi\xEAn \u0110\u1EA1i h\u1ECDc Th\u1EE7y L\u1EE3i. T\xF4i c\xF9ng Bia, B\u0103ng v\xE0 B\u1EA3o thu\xEA chung m\u1ED9t c\u0103n nh\xE0 \u0111\u1EC3 ti\u1EC7n \u0111i h\u1ECDc.\n\nNh\xE0 v\u1ED1n c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD h\xE0ng b\xEAn n\u1ED9i. B\xE0 cho thu\xEA r\u1EBB, nh\u1EDD ch\xFAng t\xF4i tr\xF4ng nom v\xE0 gi\u1EEF y\xEAn t\u0129nh \u1EDF ph\xF2ng th\u1EDD tr\xEAn g\xE1c.\n\n\u1EDE \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1ED9t th\u1EDDi gian, nh\u1EEFng chuy\u1EC7n l\u1EA1 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u."
